    fix(prd): anchor CLI path resolution to .claude/; migrate templates SoT into src/ (#63)
    
    * fix(prd): anchor PRD CLI path resolution to .claude/; migrate templates SoT into src/
    
    The PRD pipeline crashed with FileNotFoundError on
    `src/superclaude/skills/prd/refs/build-request-template.md` whenever
    `superclaude prd run` was invoked from any CWD outside the IronClaude
    repo. Root cause: `_discover_skill_refs_dir` resolved candidates as
    CWD-relative paths. The same shape latently affected
    `PrdConfig.template_path` (default was `docs/docs-product/templates/prd_template.md`,
    a path that doesn't exist anywhere).
    
    Architectural shift: all PRD-pipeline runtime path resolution now anchors
    to `.claude/` (project-local first, user-home second), with a dev-tree
    fallback for editable installs. `src/superclaude/` is the dev source of
    truth that gets synced via `make sync-dev` and installed via
    `superclaude install`.
    
    Changes:
    - `src/superclaude/cli/prd/models.py`: new `_default_skill_refs_dir` and
      `_default_template_path` helpers anchored to `.claude/`. `PrdConfig`
      default_factory uses them.
    - `src/superclaude/cli/prd/config.py`: `_discover_skill_refs_dir`
      delegates to the new single source of truth.
    - New `src/superclaude/templates/{workflow,documents}/` as SoT for 15
      templates (PRD, TDD, MDTM, release-spec, etc.).
    - `git mv src/superclaude/examples/prd_template.md ->
      src/superclaude/templates/workflow/05_prd_template.md` preserves
      history of the LARGE 1389-line PRD schema. Renamed the legacy
      145-line `.claude/templates/workflow/05_prd_template.md` to
      `.legacy-rf-project.md`.
    - `Makefile`: `make sync-dev` and `make verify-sync` now handle
      `src/superclaude/templates/ <-> .claude/templates/`.
    - New `src/superclaude/cli/install_templates.py` wired into
      `superclaude install` as Step 6. Excludes any `agent-memory/` path
      defensively (the per-agent runtime memory directory must never be
      touched by the installer).
    - Updated 12 in-tree textual references from
      `src/superclaude/examples/prd_template.md` ->
      `.claude/templates/workflow/05_prd_template.md` in SKILL.md and
      refs/{agent-prompts,build-request-template,synthesis-mapping,validation-checklists,operational-guidance}.md.
    - `tests/cli/prd/test_path_resolution.py`: 8 new regression tests
      using `monkeypatch` to pin `Path.cwd()` and `Path.home()` to
      `tmp_path`, asserting both helpers return absolute `.claude/`-
      anchored paths from any CWD (including a total-miss case that
      guarantees `FileNotFoundError` cites an absolute path, not a
      relative one).
    - `tests/cli/prd/test_prompts.py`: fixture path updated to the new
      template location.
    
    Verification:
    - `uv run pytest tests/cli/prd/ -v` => 76 passed (8 new + 68 existing,
      zero regressions).
    - `make verify-sync` => all components in sync including the new
      Templates section.
    - `uv run ruff check` clean on all changed code files.
    - Smoke from foreign CWD (`/tmp`): both helpers return absolute paths
      under `~/.claude/`, no relative-path FileNotFoundError.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
    
    * fix(install,Makefile): address PR #63 review feedback
    
    - install_{templates,core,agents,commands}.py: widen the
      "nothing installed" guard with `and not failed` so per-file
      failure details (e.g., PermissionError) are not discarded
      by an early return with a misleading "source directory
      empty?" message. Matches the existing precedent at
      install_skills.py:114. Resolves PR #63 comment r3275576561.
    
    - Makefile: revert 3 inadvertently-included verify-deps
      additions (PHONY token, target body, help echo) that
      belong to the CliEval pipeline (R-015 / AC3 / T01.17) and
      were swept into commit 1150b41 from pre-existing dirty
      state. The verify-deps target + scripts/verify_deps.py +
      scripts/dependency_baseline.txt will land together in the
      CliEval PR. Resolves PR #63 comment r3275576568.
    
    - New regression test tests/cli/test_install_failures.py:
      monkeypatches shutil.copy2 to raise PermissionError for
      all four installers and asserts the returned message
      contains failure details and does NOT contain the
      misleading "source directory empty?" string.
    
